  "title": "BLF: Fix LIN parsing",
  "description": "LIN was broken because its payload was treated as a variable length field, while it is always 8 bytes\n\nFix DLC parsing to allow only 8 bytes instead of 15\n\n\nFix ID parsing to take only the lower 6 bits\n\nParse checksum field\n\n\nDepends on !12524",
